The OE mailing list server is allow mail to be sent to either the
lists.openzaurus.org or openzaurus.org domains, causing confusion and
duplicate e-mails for those of us who are used to the technology being
smart enough to handle things correctly.

Could someone please make it so that one of the 2 is the allowed one
and the other bounces so that these problems can be squelched?

For example, both openembedded-devel@lists.openembedded.org and
openembedded-devel@openembedded.org work for this mailing list. When
someone sends mail to openembedded-devel@openembedded.org the list
then adds openembedded-devel@lists.openembedded.org to the headers and
a quick reply ends up going to both addresses.

